WEBVTT

53:30.824 --> 53:33.784
Ya gotta help us, please! You don't
know what it's like over here!

53:33.869 --> 53:35.202
Come on.
Let's get outta here.

53:35.287 --> 53:37.913
Go back to your lives, citizens.
Show's over.

53:37.998 --> 53:40.583
Come back! Slink!

53:40.667 --> 53:44.587
Slink! Please!
Please! Listen to me!

53:44.671 --> 53:47.923
No! No! Come back!

53:48.008 --> 53:50.509
Slinky!

53:59.269 --> 54:01.770
Buzz! Go away!
